{"title":"2013 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/8/ff89b077cd1531a692317e0d00486955dd38f823.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(4 + 44 + 444) \\div 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"146\" height=\"20\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/2/a02ab32cc2384370bf59c5f2a03825072d192210.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 111 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 123 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 459 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 489 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 456$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"442\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/c/d7cbb234835cddaa926c2e2b8e1c4e91065aed97.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(4 + 44 + 444) \\div 4 = 492 \\div 4 = \\boxed {\\textbf {(B) } 123}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"327\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h